33
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,920
It will be best for both of us.

34
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,230
Fine...

35
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,950
Wang Lin, take care.

36
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,160
It's the law of the jungle

37
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,400
