68
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,760
Look at the sky !

69
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,710
So impressive !

70
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,710
Be quiet,

71
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,830
