103
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,470
How utterly ridiculous.

104
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:01,920
Qin Gulei\NXuan Dao Sect Elder\NPeak Late stage\NFoundation Establishment

105
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,520
Ouyang Dao\NXuan Dao Sect Elder\NPeak Late stage\NFoundation Establishment

106
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,590
Junior Brother,

107
