180
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:41,640
Wang Lin's room\NHeng Yue Sect

181
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,390
Thank you for saving me earlier.

182
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,870
You're my disciple,

183
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:47,350
