190
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:12,190
Is disciple too slow ?

191
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:14,150
I'll cultivate harder then.

192
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:18,270
This kid seems honest but is actually cunning.

193
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:21,630
