201
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,710
so I can be proud of you.

202
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:38,830
Understood.

203
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,680
Master, have some tea.

204
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,270
Sure.

205
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:50,240
Pine Peak Mountain\NHeng Yue Sect

206
