217
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:05,320
Li Qiqing\NLuo River Sect disciple\NMiddle stage Foundation Establishment

218
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:08,240
Their cultivators focus mostly on combat

219
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,710
