240
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,080
13th layer of Qi Condensation ?

241
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:08,030
I'm the Xuan Dao Sect's top disciple,

242
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:09,070
Zhou Peng.

243
00:18:10,040 --> 00:18:10,590
You...

244
