251
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:34,240
Lu Song\NHeng Yue Sect disciple\N10th layer of Qi Condensation

252
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:35,800
Senior Brother Lu Song !

253
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:38,130
He's the best disciple Heng Yue had in the past century.

254
00:18:38,150 --> 00:18:39,590
I'm sure he'll win !

255
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:42,110
Lu Song's sword qi is impressive.

256
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:43,600
