261
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:26,080
Go !

262
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,430
Who's next !?

263
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:06,640
The Heng Yue Sect really is worthless.

264
00:20:09,800 --> 00:20:11,310
You're just a bunch of trash !

265
00:20:34,330 --> 00:22:36,250
A breakthrough in cultivation is when a character levels up and overcomes their current bottleneck in cultivation. Breakthroughs are always important moments because they mean an increase in power.\NCultivation realms for Qi Condensation are segmented into layers numbered from 1 to 15.\NLater cultivation realms are segmented between early stage, middle stage, late stage and peak late stage.\NWhether it's going from a sub-level to another one or advancing to the next realm of cultivation, it always involves a breakthrough.\N\NA LOT of stuff is getting cut & rewritten here, I won't go over all of it because there is just too much and most of it won't have too many consequences. Just know that novel Wang Lin doesn't go from layer 1 to layer 14 in one go but has to work for it.

266
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:45,520
I've been walking this path for endless years

267
00:20:42,530 --> 00:20:45,520
