268
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:51,120
Is it the compass of fate

269
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:51,120
that wrote this outcome for us ?

270
00:20:51,280 --> 00:20:57,040
The heavens want to erase your existence,

271
00:20:57,160 --> 00:21:02,760
that's the obsession guiding me.

272
00:21:03,040 --> 00:21:08,360
Is this the path to uncover

273
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:08,360
truths from falsehoods ?

274
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:13,960
In a world of murk and shadow,

275
00:21:10,540 --> 00:21:13,960
only the flame of truth can light the way.

276
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:19,680
Look at them all,

277
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:19,680
being carried by the waves.

278
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:24,320
Look at them all,

279
00:21:22,280 --> 00:21:24,320
being drowned.

280
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:27,640
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

281
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:30,720
I will let the world refine my soul.

282
00:21:30,850 --> 00:21:36,280
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

283
00:21:32,540 --> 00:21:36,280
I will fight.

284
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:39,400
I'll break through the abyss of despair

285
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:42,440
to finally learn who I really am.

286
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:47,800
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

287
00:21:44,320 --> 00:21:47,800
I embrace this obsession.

288
00:21:47,800 --> 00:21:50,760
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

289
00:21:50,760 --> 00:21:53,560
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

290
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:59,040
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

291
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:59,040
I'll still fight.

292
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:02,400
It's hard to avoid loneliness

293
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:05,440
when you are above everyone else.

294
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:11,120
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

295
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:11,120
be afraid of a firefly ?
